    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q1">
      <question_stem>A: Wie _____________ dir die Bluse?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>gefällt</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · gefallen
정답은 ①이다. '블라우스가 네 마음에 드니?'는 Wie gefällt dir die Bluse?로 표현한다. gefallen은 3격(dir)을 요구하고 사물이 주어가 된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>gefällt</choice_text>
          <commentary>'블라우스가 마음에 드니'는 gefallen + 3격 dir로 표현하므로 gefällt가 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>hat</choice_text>
          <commentary>haben은 3격 dir와 함께 이런 의미를 만들지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>findet</choice_text>
          <commentary>finden은 4격 목적어를 취하므로 dir와 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>nimmt</choice_text>
          <commentary>nehmen은 '가져가다'로 문맥과 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q2">
      <question_stem>A: Es geht mir schlecht!</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>fehlt</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · Was fehlt dir?
정답은 ③이다. 몸이 좋지 않다는 말에 '어디가 아프니?'라고 물을 때 Was fehlt dir (denn)?를 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>gibt</choice_text>
          <commentary>geben은 '어디가 아프니'의 의미가 되지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>tut</choice_text>
          <commentary>Was tut dir weh?처럼 weh가 있어야 성립한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>fehlt</choice_text>
          <commentary>Was fehlt dir?는 '어디가 안 좋니'라는 표현이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>kommt</choice_text>
          <commentary>kommen은 문맥과 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q3">
      <question_stem>In den letzten drei Wochen war ich sehr beschäftigt. Endlich habe ich heute einen Tag ___________.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>frei</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · einen Tag frei haben
정답은 ②이다. 3주 동안 바빴다가 드디어 하루 쉰다는 뜻이므로 einen Tag frei haben이 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>besetzt</choice_text>
          <commentary>besetzt는 '자리가 찬'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>frei</choice_text>
          <commentary>einen Tag frei haben은 '하루 쉬다'이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>leer</choice_text>
          <commentary>leer는 '비어 있는'으로 하루와 어울리지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>voll</choice_text>
          <commentary>voll은 '가득 찬'으로 문맥과 반대이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q4">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 들어갈 어미가 나머지와 다른 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>어미</keyword>
        <keyword>나머지와</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Der reich___ Mann hat keine Kinder.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 형용사 어미 변화
정답은 ②이다. ① 무관사 남성 4격 großen, ③ 지시대명사 뒤 복수 schönen, ④ 정관사 복수 3격 nächsten은 모두 -en이다. ② 정관사 남성 1격 뒤 약변화는 reiche로 -e이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Mama, ich habe groß___ Hunger.</choice_text>
          <commentary>관사 없는 남성 4격 großen Hunger로 -en이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Der reich___ Mann hat keine Kinder.</choice_text>
          <commentary>정관사 뒤 남성 1격은 der reiche Mann으로 -e이므로 나머지와 달라 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Wo hast du diese schön___ Blumen gekauft?</choice_text>
          <commentary>지시사 뒤 복수는 diese schönen Blumen으로 -en이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>In den nächst___ Sommerferien besuche ich sie.</choice_text>
          <commentary>정관사 뒤 복수 3격은 den nächsten으로 -en이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="5" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q5">
      <question_stem>㉠, ㉡에 들어갈 말을 바르게 연결한 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>연결한</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>unternommen angesehen</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · unternehmen과 sich ansehen
정답은 ④이다. '이미 많은 것을 했다(활동했다)'는 viel unternehmen, '전시를 관람했다'는 sich Ausstellungen ansehen으로 표현한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>gemacht besucht</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉡의 sich ansehen이 필요하다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>übernachtet gebracht</choice_text>
          <commentary>übernachten과 bringen은 문맥에 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>zugesehen gefragt</choice_text>
          <commentary>zusehen과 fragen은 문맥에 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>unternommen angesehen</choice_text>
          <commentary>viel unternehmen(많은 것을 하다)과 sich Ausstellungen ansehen(전시를 관람하다)이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q6">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 들어갈 말로 적절한 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>bevor</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 접속사 bevor
정답은 ④이다. 뒤에 정동사 후치 부문장(ich ... fahre)이 오므로 종속접속사 bevor(~하기 전에)가 알맞다. davor와 vorher는 부사, vor는 전치사이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>davor</choice_text>
          <commentary>davor는 부사로 문장을 연결하는 접속사가 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>vorher</choice_text>
          <commentary>vorher는 부사이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>vor</choice_text>
          <commentary>vor는 전치사이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>bevor</choice_text>
          <commentary>종속접속사 bevor(～하기 전에)가 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="7" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q7">
      <question_stem>문법적으로 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문법적</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Wir gehen täglich mit dem Fuß zur Universität.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · zu Fuß
정답은 ①이다. '걸어서'는 zu Fuß로 표현하므로 mit dem Fuß는 옳지 않다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Wir gehen täglich mit dem Fuß zur Universität.</choice_text>
          <commentary>'걸어서'는 zu Fuß로 표현하므로 mit dem Fuß는 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Ich gratuliere Ihnen herzlich zum Geburtstag.</choice_text>
          <commentary>jemandem zum Geburtstag gratulieren은 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Das Kind sitzt auf dem Stuhl.</choice_text>
          <commentary>auf dem Stuhl sitzen(3격)은 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Wir danken Ihnen für die Einladung.</choice_text>
          <commentary>jemandem für etwas danken은 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q8">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 쓰임이 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>쓰임</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Mein Bruder legt sich &lt;u&gt;neben mich&lt;/u&gt;.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 전치사의 격 지배
정답은 ④이다. neben은 방향이면 4격을 쓰므로 sich neben mich legen이 옳다. denken an은 4격(an dich), bei는 3격(bei seinem Onkel), glauben an은 4격(an das Glück)을 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Ich denke immer &lt;u&gt;an dir&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>denken an은 4격을 취하므로 an dich이어야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Er arbeitet &lt;u&gt;bei seinen Onkel&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>bei는 3격을 취하므로 bei seinem Onkel이어야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Ich glaube wirklich &lt;u&gt;über dem Glück&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>'행운을 믿다'는 an das Glück glauben이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Mein Bruder legt sich &lt;u&gt;neben mich&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>sich legen은 방향을 나타내므로 neben + 4격 mich가 옳아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="9" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q9">
      <question_stem>문법적으로 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문법적</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Der Redner war schlecht vorgebereitet.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 과거분사의 형태
정답은 ②이다. vorbereiten은 비분리 전철 be-가 있어 ge-가 중간에 붙지 않고 vorbereitet가 된다. vorgebereitet는 잘못된 형태이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Der Streit wurde schnell beigelegt.</choice_text>
          <commentary>beilegen의 과거분사 beigelegt는 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Der Redner war schlecht vorgebereitet.</choice_text>
          <commentary>vorbereiten의 과거분사는 vorbereitet이므로 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Die Frau hat schon 5 kg abgenommen.</choice_text>
          <commentary>abnehmen의 과거분사 abgenommen은 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Der Mann ist in den falschen Zug eingestiegen.</choice_text>
          <commentary>einsteigen의 과거분사 eingestiegen과 조동사 sein은 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="10" id="PRB-4080C4C475DA8811-Q10">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분을 우리말로 바르게 옮긴 것은?</question_stem>
