      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Nichts</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · Nichts zu danken
정답은 ③이다. 감사 인사에 '천만에요'라고 답할 때 Nichts zu danken!을 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Um</choice_text>
          <commentary>Um zu danken은 감사 인사에 대한 관용 대답이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Bitte</choice_text>
          <commentary>Bitte zu danken은 관용 표현이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Nichts</choice_text>
          <commentary>Nichts zu danken(감사할 것 없어요)이 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Ohne</choice_text>
          <commentary>Ohne zu danken은 '감사하지 않고'라는 뜻이 된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
